{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932590/extras/forest.gif?t=1678508107\" /><br><br>bearcycle\u00ae combines fast-paced motorcycle racing with wacky platforming madness. Bounce your way through the forest, grind and grapple in the city, and rocket your way through space!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932590/extras/le1-banner.gif?t=1678508107\" /><br><br>Create your own custom levels via the built-in Level Editor, and easily share them online! Explore other user's online levels, and stake a claim for a World Record.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932590/extras/moon.gif?t=1678508107\" /><br><br>Chain together combos of tricks, flips, and wheelies to build up MASSIVE multipliers! Customize your ride, and play as different characters with their own unique tricks!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932590/extras/garage-banner.gif?t=1678508107\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1932590?t=1678508107","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1932590?t=1678508107","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932590/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1678508107","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932590/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1678508107","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2007600,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932590/extras/forest.gif?t=167